<h2 class="no-num" id="1-scope">1 Scope</h2>

This document describes the carriage of some forms of timed text and subtitle streams in files based on ISO/IEC 14496-12 (the ISO base media file format). The documentation of these forms does not preclude other definition of carriage of timed text or subtitles; see, for example, 3GPP Timed Text (3GPP TS 26.245), or the carriage of captioning information embedded in a media stream of another type (see <a href="#annex-a-informative-captioning-information-embedded-in-a-media-stream-of-another-type">Annex A</a>).
